  <text>
    <status value="generated"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap NgHivLocalToWHOHiv</b></p><a name="NgHivLocalToWHOHiv"> </a><a name="hcNgHivLocalToWHOHiv"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href="ValueSet-ng-hiv-local-concepts.html">Nigeria HIV Local Concepts</a> to <a href="ValueSet-ng-who-hiv-concepts-vs.html">Nigeria Relevant WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-art-follow-up-status-cs.html">HIV Follow Up Status CodeSystem</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>lost (Lost to follow-up)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE42 (Lost to follow-up)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>to (Transfer out)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE43 (Transferred out)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>dead</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE44 (Death (documented))</td><td>WHO requires documented death; the local Dead concept does not itself assert documentation.</td></tr><tr><td>restart</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE45 (Restarting ART)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>stop (Stopped treatment)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE40 (Stopped ART)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>stop (Stopped treatment)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE45 (Refused (stopped) treatment)</td><td>To add details later</td></tr><tr><td>alive-on-art</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE47 (On ART)</td><td/></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-arv-adherence-cs.html">HIV-ARV Adherence CodeSystem</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>Stopped</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact" title="inexact">maps loosely to</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE40 (Stopped ART)</td><td>The local code is used in an adherence/status context, while the WHO concept explicitly represents ART treatment status.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-dsd-reason-for-category-change-cs.html">HIV DSD - Reason For Category Change CodeSystem</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>Dead</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE44 (Death (documented))</td><td>WHO requires documented death; the local Dead concept is broader.</td></tr><tr><td>Lost</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE42 (Lost to follow-up)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>TO</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE43 (Transferred out)</td><td/></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 4 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-positive-tracking-cs.html">HIV Positive Tracking</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>Not-Started (ART Not Started)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE4 (Did not initiate ART)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>Started-ART</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE382 (ART initiated within 7 days of diagnosis)</td><td>WHO is narrower because it requires ART initiation within 7 days of diagnosis; the local code does not specify timing.</td></tr><tr><td>Linked-To-Care (Linked to care and treatment)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.B.DE147 (Linked to enrolment in care and ART initiation)</td><td>WHO additionally specifies enrolment in care and ART initiation; the local linkage concept is broader.</td></tr><tr><td>Final-Outcome</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact" title="inexact">maps loosely to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE41 (HIV Treatement outcome)</td><td>The local concept identifies a final tracking outcome, while WHO identifies the HIV treatment outcome data element.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 5 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-final-outcome-cs.html">HIV - Final Outcome CodeSystem</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>lost-to-follow-up</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE42 (Lost to follow-up)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>died</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE44 (Death (documented))</td><td>WHO requires documented death; the local Died concept is broader.</td></tr><tr><td>declined</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE45 (Refused (stopped) treatment)</td><td>WHO specifically represents refusal with stopped treatment; the local Declined outcome is broader.</td></tr><tr><td>started-art</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE382 (ART initiated within 7 days of diagnosis)</td><td>WHO is narrower because it limits initiation to within 7 days of diagnosis.</td></tr><tr><td>confirmed-referral</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact" title="inexact">maps loosely to</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE49 (Transfer confirmed)</td><td>The local concept represents a confirmed referral, while WHO represents a confirmed transfer.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 6 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-reason-not-started-art-cs.html">HIV - Reason Not Started ART CodeSystem</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>declined</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE371 (Patient self-reported as not ready/willing)</td><td>WHO specifically states that the patient self-reported not being ready or willing; the local Declined category is broader.</td></tr><tr><td>on-adherence-preparation</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact" title="inexact">maps loosely to</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE372 (Not completed education, support and preparation for ART)</td><td>Both refer to preparation before ART initiation, but the local status and WHO reason-for-delay concepts are not identical.</td></tr><tr><td>known-positive-on-art (Known +ve on ART)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider" title="wider">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>HIV.H.DE47 (On ART)</td><td>WHO On ART is broader because it does not additionally encode the local known-positive context.</td></tr><tr><td>on-oi-management</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE377 (Patient diagnosed with cryptococcal meningitis)</td><td>Cryptococcal meningitis is one specific reason within the broader local On OI management category. Do not automatically select this target without diagnosis context.</td></tr><tr><td>on-oi-management</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-narrower" title="narrower">narrower</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE378 (Patient diagnosed with histoplasmosis)</td><td>Histoplasmosis is one specific reason within the broader local On OI management category. Do not automatically select this target without diagnosis context.</td></tr><tr><td>other (Other Specify here)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE380 (Other)</td><td/></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 7 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-target-population-category-cs.html">Target Population Category Codes</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>Female-Commercial-Sex-Workers</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider" title="wider">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>HIV.B.DE51 (Sex worker)</td><td>WHO Sex worker is broader because it is not restricted to female sex workers.</td></tr><tr><td>MSM</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.B.DE52 (Men who have sex with men)</td><td>WHO includes both trans and gender-diverse people; the local TG category is narrower.</td></tr><tr><td>TG</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider" title="wider">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>HIV.B.DE53 (Trans and gender-diverse people)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>People-Who-Inject-Drug</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>HIV.B.DE54 (People who inject drugs)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>OVC-AIDS-Orphaned (OVC or AIDS Orphaned)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-wider" title="wider">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>HIV.B.DE58 (Orphan or vulnerable child)</td><td>WHO Orphan or vulnerable child is broader than the local HIV/AIDS-oriented OVC category.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 8 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-tb-tpt-prophylaxis-type-cs.html">TB TPT Prophylaxis Type Codes</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>inh</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact" title="inexact">maps loosely to</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE250 (Provide isoniazid preventive therapy)</td><td>The local code identifies isoniazid prophylaxis type; WHO represents the action of providing isoniazid preventive therapy.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 9 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-ng-hiv-enhanced-adherence-counselling-status-cs.html">Enhanced Adherence Counselling</a> to <a href="CodeSystem-ng-who-hiv-concepts-cs.html">Nigeria Local WHO HIV Concepts</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>eac (Enhanced Adherence Counselling)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-inexact" title="inexact">maps loosely to</a></td><td>HIV.D.DE496 (Enhanced adherence counselling provided)</td><td>The local concept identifies enhanced adherence counselling; WHO explicitly represents that counselling was provided.</td></tr></table></div>
